  "description": "The Daley Carbon frameset combines the versatility of a modern all-mountain bike with the performance of contemporary carbon technology. With 140 millimeters of rear suspension travel and geometry optimized for 150-millimeter forks, the frame offers a balanced mix of uphill efficiency, agility on the trail, and safety on the descent. The frameset is delivered with the FOX FLOAT X Performance Series rear shock, ensuring a sensitive response and consistent performance across a wide range of trail conditions.\nThe street art-inspired graphics give the Daley Carbon a distinctive, modern design language and deliberately set it apart from classic, understated trail bikes. Function and design come together seamlessly here.\nThe high-quality carbon frame impresses with its high stiffness, low weight, and well-thought-out details—the perfect foundation for individual trail and all-mountain builds.",
